Sanaullah bhai, aapne bilkul sahi point pakda hai.

**Masla (The Issue):**
LinkedIn par **"Jobs"** page ka structure **"Posts"** se alag hota hai. Wahan "Split View" hota hai:

1. **Left Side:** Jobs ki scrollable list hoti hai.
2. **Right Side:** Selected job ki details hoti hain.

Standard `window.scrollBy` command puray page ko scroll karti hai (jo Jobs page par lock hoti hai), isliye scraper stuck ho jata hai. Hamein specifically us **Left Side walay Container** ko target karke scroll karna padega.

**Hal (The Solution):**
Maine `src/scraper.py` file mein `human_like_scroll` function ko update kiya hai. Ab ye check karega ke agar category "Jobs" hai, toh ye **Jobs List container** (`jobs-search-results-list`) ko dhund kar sirf usay scroll karega. Baaki "Posts" waghaira ke liye purana tareeka hi chalega.

Yeh rahi aapki puri updated `src/scraper.py` file. Isay copy karein aur replace kar dein.

